# Worker unit

Import Conventions from "./conventions.lg".
Import HostFiles from "./host_files.lg".
Import WorkRecord from "./work_record.lg".
Import VerdictRecord from "./verdict_record.lg".
Import TrailRecord from "./trail_record.lg".
Import TrailMemory from "./trail_memory.lg".
Import AttemptRecord from "./attempt_record.lg".
Import Extraction from "./extraction.lg".
Import ChatRequest from "./chat_request.lg".
Import Budget from "./budget.lg".
Import Replay from "./replay.lg".
Import LocalSettings from "./local_settings.lg".
Import LocalPlan from "./local_plan.lg".
Import LocalAttempt from "./local_attempt.lg".
Import CoordinatorWire from "./coordinator_wire.lg".
Import WorkerClient from "./worker_client.lg".
Import WorkerPrompt from "./worker_prompt.lg".
Import WorkerJudge from "./worker_judge.lg".

One leased unit worked to its posted attempt: the request built, its worst case
held against the budget (or the honest stop posted when it does not fit), the
model asked, the lease kept alive, the answer judged by the kernel here, and the
attempt posted with its trail entry sealed onto the head the grant named.

## A WorkerSettings has:
    a base, which is Text.
    a holder, which is Text.
    a focus, which is Text.
    a kinds, which is Text.
    a ttlMs, which is Int.
    a workspace, which is Text.
    a local, which is LocalSettings.

## A UnitStep has:
    a line, which is Text.
    a stop, which is Bool.

## Note
The attempt a judged answer makes, ready to post.

## To submissionOf (ws: WorkerSettings, g: LeaseGrant, u: WorkUnit, token: Int, request: ChatRequest, model: Text, answer: Text, j: WorkJudged, cost: Int, startedAt: Int) -> AttemptSubmission:
    Let files be workArtifacts(chatRequestJson(request), answer, j).
    Let strategyId be (grantStrategy(g, u's kind))'s id.
    Let mutable a be a new Attempt with id "" and unitId u's id and problemId u's problemId and contributor ws's holder and model model and strategyId strategyId.
    Set a's promptSha to promptSha(request).
    Set a's responseSha to sha256Hex(answer).
    If j's document is not equal to "":
        Set a's documentSha to sha256Hex(j's document).
    Set a's approachFingerprint to j's fingerprint.
    Set a's verdict to j's verdict.
    Set a's costMicros to cost.
    Set a's startedAt to startedAt.
    Set a's finishedAt to clockMs().
    Let mutable e be blankEntry(u's problemId, u's kind, j's verdict's kind, shortenText(verdictDiagnostics(j's verdict), 60000)).
    Set e's ts to startedAt.
    Set e's contributor to ws's holder.
    Set e's model to model.
    Set e's strategyId to strategyId.
    Set e's promptSha to a's promptSha.
    Set e's approachFingerprint to j's fingerprint.
    Set e's artifactShas to artifactShasOf(files).
    Set e's exitCode to verdictExit(j's verdict).
    Set e's costMicros to cost.
    Set e's summary to shortenText(j's extraction's summary, 4000).
    Set e's nextSuggestions to j's extraction's suggestions.
    Let mutable s be a new AttemptSubmission with unitId u's id and token token and holder ws's holder and secret g's secret.
    Set s's attempt to a.
    Set s's entry to sealEntry(e, g's trailSeq + 1, g's trailHead).
    Set s's artifacts to files.
    Set s's draft to j's draft.
    Return s.

## Note
A posted attempt, as one line of the worker's log.

## To postedLine (u: WorkUnit, j: WorkJudged, cost: Int, p: Posted) -> Text:
    Let head be u's kind + " " + u's id + " on " + u's problemId + ": " + j's verdict's kind + " · " + formatMicros(cost).
    If p's status is equal to 201:
        Return head + " · recorded (" + p's receipt's outcome + ")".
    Return head + " · refused {p's status} " + p's receipt's outcome + ": " + p's receipt's detail.

## Note
The unit `u`, leased under `token`, worked.

## To workLeased (ws: WorkerSettings, g: LeaseGrant, u: WorkUnit, token: Int, budget: Budget) -> (UnitStep, Budget):
    Let startedAt be clockMs().
    Let request be workerRequest(ws's base, g, u's kind, u's problemId).
    Let strategyId be (grantStrategy(g, u's kind))'s id.
    Inspect priceFor(ws's workspace, ws's local, request's model):
        When Err (e):
            Return (a new UnitStep with line "no price for " + request's model + ": " + e and stop true, budget).
        When Ok (price):
            Let held be reservationMicros(price, request).
            Inspect reserve(budget, held):
                When Err (stop):
                    Let j be budgetJudged(u, strategyId, stop).
                    Let p be postAttempt(ws's base, submissionOf(ws, g, u, token, request, request's model, "", j, 0, startedAt)).
                    Return (a new UnitStep with line postedLine(u, j, 0, p) and stop true, budget).
                When Ok (holding):
                    Inspect askModel(ws's local, request):
                        When Err (why):
                            Return (a new UnitStep with line "no answer on " + u's id + ": " + why and stop true, settle(holding, held, 0)).
                        When Ok (reply):
                            Let cost be actualCostMicros(price, reply, held).
                            Let after be settle(holding, held, cost).
                            If heartbeatLease(ws's base, g, ws's holder, ws's ttlMs) is equal to false:
                                Return (a new UnitStep with line "the lease on " + u's id + " moved on while the model answered" and stop false, after).
                            Let j be judgeWork(u's kind, grantStatement(g, u's problemId), strategyId, reply's content, ws's holder + " " + reply's model).
                            Let p be postAttempt(ws's base, submissionOf(ws, g, u, token, request, reply's model, reply's content, j, cost, startedAt)).
                            Return (a new UnitStep with line postedLine(u, j, cost, p) and stop (p's status is equal to 0), after).
    Return (a new UnitStep with line "unworked" and stop true, budget).
